    {
      "id": "TND4kvTV6ONwVhOSMsmTH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830.6991823126575,
      "y": 411.33868364055996,
      "width": 594,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1181705366,
      "version": 681,
      "versionNonce": 1219373272,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "bomqJiw-dsF4uk9em_dmq",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1753859182405,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Insertion in binary search trees\n2. Nodes in binary search trees\n3. Properties of the Binary Search trees \n4. Traversal in Binary Trees \n5. Display the binary trees\n6. populate Binary Trees with Sorted Arrays\n7. isBalanced()\n8. Time Complexity analysis of Insertion and Traversal\n9. Log(N) == N for chain formation in BST \n10. Representation of BST",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Insertion in binary search trees\n2. Nodes in binary search trees\n3. Properties of the Binary Search trees \n4. Traversal in Binary Trees \n5. Display the binary trees\n6. populate Binary Trees with Sorted Arrays\n7. isBalanced()\n8. Time Complexity analysis of Insertion and Traversal\n9. Log(N) == N for chain formation in BST \n10. Representation of BST",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8oyOXrhViv66Zgm7n0FLa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1942.1771966590477,
      "y": 61.51031194615598,
      "width": 850.7391357421875,
      "height": 805.8542156269365,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "Jtsx_E9v-oFrQNy-tCpxB",
      "index": "bUf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1218816268,
      "version": 1039,
      "versionNonce": 938660008,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753857534313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "public class Node {\n    public int val;\n    Node right;\n    Node left;\n    Node height;\n    \n\n    public Node(int value){\n        this.val=value;\n     }\n    \n    public int getValue(){\n        return this.val;   \n    }\n\n}\n\n// A method outside of Node class to the height of the Node \n\npublic int Height(Node node){\n    if(node == null) return 0;\n\n    return node.height;\n}\n    ",
      "fontSize": 25.787334900061964,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "public class Node {\n    public int val;\n    Node right;\n    Node left;\n    Node height;\n    \n\n    public Node(int value){\n        this.val=value;\n     }\n    \n    public int getValue(){\n        return this.val;   \n    }\n\n}\n\n// A method outside of Node class to the height of the Node \n\npublic int Height(Node node){\n    if(node == null) return 0;\n\n    return node.height;\n}\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vHtkjwK48RiIxPwj_mgYL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1944.376490655623,
      "y": 877.6039956353106,
      "width": 859.7869873046875,
      "height": 60.14087248026648,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "Jtsx_E9v-oFrQNy-tCpxB",
      "index": "bUg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1801871924,
      "version": 805,
      "versionNonce": 299757016,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753857534313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It is important to note that the height of each of the individual\nNode is set during the insertion operation in those Node ",
      "fontSize": 24.056348992106592,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It is important to note that the height of each of the individual\nNode is set during the insertion operation in those Node ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Jtsx_E9v-oFrQNy-tCpxB",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": -1993.3330357825857,
      "y": 1.4410597810551735,
      "width": 942.507787502634,
      "height": 978.1618536108839,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#bbb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 796107572,
      "version": 846,
      "versionNonce": 1973582760,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753857534313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "name": "Structure of Nodes in Binary Search Trees"
    },
    {
      "id": "EgO3mgMNx4HPsr_wCrgwg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -302.2676489657558,
      "y": 1369.7881071756958,
      "width": 1223.5072021484375,
      "height": 179.4397974541935,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9MvKWUo0nBb13xaQkvWc4",
      "index": "bUi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1906744756,
      "version": 673,
      "versionNonce": 2026435078,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1755453500772,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One of the drawbacks of BST is that it will eventually form a chain and convert into a \nLinkedList if the numbers are being inserted in sorted orders ==> unbalanced binary tree\n \nIn order to overcome and optimize this problem we can keep on inserting the middle element \nof the sorted arrays first in the binary search trees in order to keep it relatively balanced\n",
      "fontSize": 23.9253063272258,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One of the drawbacks of BST is that it will eventually form a chain and convert into a \nLinkedList if the numbers are being inserted in sorted orders ==> unbalanced binary tree\n \nIn order to overcome and optimize this problem we can keep on inserting the middle element \nof the sorted arrays first in the binary search trees in order to keep it relatively balanced\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "euezQ7pHaAHVJwDbt9NJm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -290.2734173398985,
      "y": 1572.4462431267812,
      "width": 694.6083215548832,
      "height": 401.35303633756746,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "9MvKWUo0nBb13xaQkvWc4",
      "index": "bUj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 407259828,
      "version": 471,
      "versionNonce": 1445250728,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753857534313,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "public Node insertSorted(int start , int end , int nums[]){\n    if(start>=end){\n        return;\n    }\n   \n    int middle = (start+end)/2;\n    \n    insert(nums[middle]);\n    insertSorted(start,middle-1,nums);\n    insertSorted(middle+1,end,nums);\n\n}\n    \n    \n",
      "fontSize": 21.40549527133692,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "public Node insertSorted(int start , int end , int nums[]){\n    if(start>=end){\n        return;\n    }\n   \n    int middle = (start+end)/2;\n    \n    insert(nums[middle]);\n    insertSorted(start,middle-1,nums);\n    insertSorted(middle+1,end,nums);\n\n}\n    \n    \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
