    {
      "id": "dcI4BinSz92GSv0MTfgYN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1461.8645359335687,
      "y": 1351.414213819541,
      "width": 1205.2743475993589,
      "height": 84.71937776003003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "UzalsiOl8BssMpIuX8pZ9",
      "index": "bV8l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 963497432,
      "version": 311,
      "versionNonce": 1711290328,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753859109720,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Checking whether a Binary Tree is Balanced or Not using the Balance Factor Rule :\n    \n    Math.abs(Height(node.left)-Height(node.right)) <= 1  ===> Then a Node is said to be balanced ",
      "fontSize": 22.591834069341317,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Checking whether a Binary Tree is Balanced or Not using the Balance Factor Rule :\n    \n    Math.abs(Height(node.left)-Height(node.right)) <= 1  ===> Then a Node is said to be balanced ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8vEs0wBiWlaz13uqp78f8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1481.4187305676537,
      "y": 1475.7215269102926,
      "width": 1294.34765625,
      "height": 95.95067164361427,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "UzalsiOl8BssMpIuX8pZ9",
      "index": "bV8t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1973075416,
      "version": 313,
      "versionNonce": 589418920,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753859109720,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Binary Tree is said to be balanced when all it's nodes are balanced \nWe can write a recursive function to check whether a tree is balanced or by checking a given\nNode and then checking the left and right subtrees of that node ",
      "fontSize": 25.586845771630472,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A Binary Tree is said to be balanced when all it's nodes are balanced \nWe can write a recursive function to check whether a tree is balanced or by checking a given\nNode and then checking the left and right subtrees of that node ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QlrFiapzkB7AhmtJJmGdw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1471.6416865309243,
      "y": 1630.8987569413853,
      "width": 1296.0353206841253,
      "height": 129.19012367265998,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "UzalsiOl8BssMpIuX8pZ9",
      "index": "bV8zV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1423587800,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 1409688024,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1753859109720,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Public boolean isBalanced(Node root){\n    \n    return Math.abs(Height(node.left)-Height(node.right)) <= 1 && isBalanced(root.left) && isBalanced(root.right);\n\n} ",
      "fontSize": 20.670419787625598,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Public boolean isBalanced(Node root){\n    \n    return Math.abs(Height(node.left)-Height(node.right)) <= 1 && isBalanced(root.left) && isBalanced(root.right);\n\n} ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
